
.subckt astra_016_cmos_correlated_double_sampler vdd VSS track reset vin vcm out
CH out VSS 2p
CP net1 VSS 100f
CS net1 net0 100p
M1 trackb track vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=10u
M10 vcm reset net1 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M2 trackb track VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=4u
M3 resetb reset vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=10u
M4 resetb reset VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=4u
M5 vin trackb net0 vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M6 vin track net0 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M7 net1 trackb out vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M8 net1 track out VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M9 vcm resetb net1 vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
RL out VSS 1g
.ends astra_016_cmos_correlated_double_sampler
